@title Parts: Add CAD files matches a file that is not named after the article
@area Parts
# A maker's CAD file is named after a document id (MCADXX0001234_3D.stp); the model inside names the article.
# The panel shows the verdict and the reasons before anything is stored, and a file for no part in the catalog says so.
fresh
key ctrl+k
text "parts"
wait 10
key Return
wait 20
shot parts-window
answer_dialog qa/fixtures/parts/cad/MCADXX0001234_3D.stp
click_text "Add CAD files"
wait 30
expect "Add CAD files"
expect "Checked"
expect "Siemens 3RT2016-1AP01"
shot matched
check_layout
click_text "Import ticked"
wait 40
expect "stored for Siemens 3RT2016-1AP01"
shot stored
answer_dialog qa/fixtures/parts/cad/MCADXX0009999_3D.stp
click_text "Done"
wait 10
click_text "Add CAD files"
wait 30
expect "No part in your catalog matches"
shot no-part
check_layout
